() Tj
0 -11 Td
(Database and Event Model) Tj
0 -11 Td
() Tj
0 -11 Td
(Bywaf stores events in SQLite. The default database is:) Tj
0 -11 Td
() Tj
0 -11 Td
(    .bywaf/bywaf.sqlite3) Tj
0 -11 Td
() Tj
0 -11 Td
(SQLite is used in WAL mode. Inserts are committed immediately; there is no) Tj
0 -11 Td
(separate document-style save step. On shutdown, Bywaf checkpoints the WAL using) Tj
0 -11 Td
(PRAGMA wal_checkpoint\(TRUNCATE\) so WAL contents are folded back into the main) Tj
0 -11 Td
(database file.) Tj
ET
